What was adapted (lib/index.js, the side-question host pipeline):
  - the "fork the current provider with tools disabled, answer once, dispose"
    pipeline (subagents.getProvider('fork') → startActivation → dispose);
  - all BTW-specific pieces were removed: its internal command plumbing, its
    tool guard, and its chat-bubble renderer.

What is original to this project:
  - the local HTTP route /dsh-annotation/ask and its NDJSON framing;
  - the prompts, request/response shapes and error strings;
  - the whole client half (selection toolbar, annotation bubble, comment chip,
    detail card, side-question modal and streaming answer card);
  - the annotation anchoring strategy (live Range → block offsets → text search).

